# Integration standard

Read [`skills/integration-standard/SKILL.md`](../skills/integration-standard/SKILL.md) when adding a **new feature** (not a one-line fix).

Follow phases in order: types → storage → migration? → repo → validator → service → api → main.mo → tests → frontend → deploy.

After migration deploy: remove `(with migration = …)`, mark APPLIED, add `reindex()` if needed.

Use `pkg/` before writing new helpers — see catalog in the skill.
